{"title":"2017 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A store sells packages of red pens and packages of blue pens. Red pens are sold only in packages of 6 pens. Blue pens are sold only in packages of 9 pens.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Igor bought 5 packages of red pens and 3 packages of blue pens. How many pens did he buy altogether?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since each package of red pens has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pens and Igor bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> packages of red pens, he bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3baf0066ce7886d39f68ef8e6ac40747eaf9ca6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 5 = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> red pens in total.\n</p><p>Since each package of blue pens has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pens and Igor bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> packages of blue pens, he bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ff2ae475e662eb83e408487daa5688a343d18bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\times 3 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> blue pens in total.\n</p><p>Thus, in total, Igor bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/a/35a74334ba9c2c1ded1918104506fb21f46fa9b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 + 27 = \\boxed{57}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" /> pens altogether.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003547\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 37/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 918/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1245/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.485      1 2017_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%   12.485      1 -total\n 42.51%    5.308      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36944:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018003547 and revision id 285790. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}